==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 10,000 seconds<sup>300,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

